{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOCUT68w","is_bot":false,"login":"ChaiXinLong-tech","name":""},"body":"Parent: #33\n/bounty $50\n\n## Scope\nAdd a focused TaskFlow API utility for detecting the Unicode invisible separator character (U+2063) in a string.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Add $path exporting $(System.Collections.Hashtable.fn)(input: string): boolean.\n- Return \true only when the input contains the invisible separator character.\n- Keep the helper dependency-free and safe for reuse in API validation paths.\n- Include local TypeScript proof for positive, negative, and empty-string cases.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABItOuaQ","author":{"login":"voladoradepapantla-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Starting this now. I'll keep it to the requested helper plus a narrow local test.","createdAt":"2026-07-03T20:49:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5014#issuecomment-4879265385","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABItO6rg","author":{"login":"voladoradepapantla-netizen"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"PR is up: https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/pull/5043","createdAt":"2026-07-03T20:49:48Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5014#issuecomment-4879268526","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABIz7EzQ","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming #5014 — `isInvisibleSeparatorPresent`. /claim #5014","createdAt":"2026-07-05T13:53:41Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/5014#issuecomment-4886283469","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABI0Btzw","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"@voladorad